      "writtenOn": "2021-05-17T10:41:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On devices that will never consume more than 45W, USB-C ports may be limited to input voltages between 5V-15V. USB-C power adapters designed to meet the original voltage profiles may not support 15V, so supporting the full 5-20V range is recommended.\n\nAre we \"never consume more than 45W\"?",
